<title>FRANCE: Rouen Nov 1-20 flour exports reach 40,055 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Nov 1-20 flour exports reach 40,055 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from the French port of Rouen reached 40,055 tonnes between November 1 and November 20, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Some 20,039 tonnes were destined for West Africa and 20,016 tonnes for Yemen, they said.</p>
<p>Flour exports totalled 31,000 tonnes in November 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
